\ A reachable method{ body the IR backend cannot compile to native code: it
\ defines a helper word inside its body, which AOT compilation cannot discover.
\ Under --emit-runtime-image the body is serialized and runs through the
\ interpreter, so the replayed method result is observed -- the generic default
\ would print -1.

counter: virtual{ fixnum } ;
bump:    generic ( c -- n ) [ drop -1 ] ;
bump:    method{ counter } [ drop helper: [ 7 ] ; helper ] ;

0 >counter bump .
